  "title": "Broken input, harder prompts, smarter anchors",
  "question": "On harder, object-heavy prompts where the text-to-motion input is clearly wrong, does the video model supply what is missing — and does picking the anchor frames smartly beat picking them evenly?",
  "status": "complete",
  "date": "2026-09-28",
